   "priceMinor": 329000,
   "currency": "EUR",
   "availability": "in_stock",
   "description": "PRICE: Option 1: €3,290.00 including taxes: StarDiver + S.Steel band without tools + micro-adjustment buckle. Option 2: Collector: €3,590.00 including taxes: StarDiver + S.Steel band without tools + micro-adjustment buckle + Box of 2 silicone bands (black + orange). Countries outside the EEC: Import taxes are included. Specifications: Water Proof 100 ATM 1,000 m / 3,300 ft. Antimagnetic (movement + cage). Automatic helium escape valve positionned at 50 min. SS316L steel in aerospace standard. Crown at 42 min. Ceramic rotating bezel, unidirectional, 60 clicks. Sapphire crystal used in aerospace of a unique quality, anti-reflect coated inside only. Screwed case back in grade 5 titanium. Date window open on three dates. Superluminova X1 densified markers and hands (50% more powerful and lasts 2X longer). Beauty of hand finishes (Black Polishing and deep brushing). ​ World's first watch band fully adjustable and micro-adjustable without tools: Quick release mechanisms on all straight links. Double control micro-adjustment buckle (push and lever). Movement : Swiss automatic manufactured by Soprod. 100% manufactured in Jura. Hours, Minutes, Seconds, Date. Accuracy 4+/- 4 seconds / day on 5 positions. Power reserve 42 hours. Antimagnetic. Chronofiable A8®. 28,800 vibrations, 4hz. Rhodium coated. Côtes de Genève on the rotor. Pearled bridges. 25 jewels. Incabloc. Glucydur balance. Dimensions: Rotating bezel: 41 mm. Length: 48mm. Height: 13.8 mm excluding sapphire / 14.8 mm sapphire included. Strap width: 24 mm at the head, 16 mm at the buckle. 3 YEARS WARRANTY",
